        negative_prompt='propaganda coloring, red-vs-blue enemy coding, glowing red danger zones, explosions, missiles, mushroom clouds, soldiers, tanks, blood, waving national flags, chess pieces on a map, puppet strings, cartoon animal-nations (eagle/bear/dragon), doomsday clock, cracked splitting earth, warped or gibberish text, misspelled country names, distorted coastlines, invented borders, oversaturated neon, rainbow choropleth, lens flare, heavy film grain, Dutch tilt, motion blur streaks, crash zoom, cluttered dashboard, too many arrows, 3D beveled text, stock-photo handshake, sensational headline chyron, ominous vignette',
