        negative_prompt='flat even lighting, bright daylight, overhead soft fill, clean dry streets, cheerful saturated colors, HDR glow, blown-out highlights, teal-orange over-grade, glossy plastic skin, smiling subject, cluttered busy background, modern glass skyscrapers, neon cyberpunk palette, lens flare spam, cartoon rain / white streak noise, fog-machine haze with no source, extra fingers, warped hands, distorted face, duplicated limbs, text, watermark, logo, captions, low contrast, muddy grey shadows, everything evenly lit',
