        negative_prompt='child, minor, teen, underage, childlike features, youthful face (all subjects must read as adults), extra fingers, fused or merged limbs, deformed hands, mutated fingers, warped anatomy, extra limbs, duplicate faces, disfigured, plastic airbrushed skin, waxy poreless over-smoothed skin, oily silicone gloss, flat on-camera flash, harsh direct flash, blown-out highlights, muddy crushed shadows, contradictory light sources, HDR halos, oversaturated, cluttered busy background, rose petals on the bed, cheesy heart props, single red rose, stock-photo laughing couple, text, watermark, logo, signature, lowres, jpeg artifacts, blurry, out-of-focus subject',
